      "narrative": "The evidence identifies Vedant as the person who struck Mira at 21:12, with Savitri knowingly holding the corridor door. The signed kitchen observation is corroborated by independent records placing the pair in the archive corridor and by Savitri\u2019s planning letter. Dev arrived after the attack and attempted aid; the sleeve stains are consistent with that. The threat attributed to Dev was forged by Savitri, who also arranged the relocation of the two old bodies. Other established misconduct includes Vedant\u2019s alteration of the register and arranging Harun\u2019s killing, Kabir\u2019s removal of Nalin\u2019s letter, and Savitri\u2019s alteration of Tara\u2019s statement. The object/voice evidence supports an influence on Savitri and Vedant, but their own account says they retained the ability to refuse; it does not displace their responsibility or establish supernatural causation of every death. Elsie\u2019s documented illness explains her death. Independent evidence excludes Dev, Raghav, Kabir, and Leena as Mira\u2019s assailants."
